Gemini SRT Translator for Bazarr

This project is an independent Bazarr companion application. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or maintained by Bazarr, Sonarr, Radarr, TMDB, or
Google.

Runtime translation is performed by the gemini-srt-translator package and its
`gst` CLI:
https://github.com/MaKTaiL/gemini-srt-translator

gemini-srt-translator is licensed separately by its upstream authors. This
repository does not vendor or redistribute the upstream source code.

The `subcore` engine (packages/subcore) adapts ideas and wording from
gemini-srt-translator: the core translation rules in its system prompt and the
JSON item contract (one `{i, text}` object per subtitle cue). Those portions are
